an>: We should ask someone ...", "id": 5, "image": "engenn2le09ob01re2img02.jpg", "time": "49300"}]}}]}, {"title": "", "id": 2, "template_override": 1, "type": "text", "_data": [], "contents": [{"type": "audio", "value": "engenn2le09ob01re6aud04"}]}], "type": "scholar", "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}]}], "type": "sena", "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Getting Lost"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Where Am I?"}, {"type": "position", "content": 1}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 9}, {"type": "level", "content": "A1.1"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Describe places, neighborhoods and countries in communicative situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": " Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": " Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": " Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": " Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": " Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": " Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": " Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Reading a Map"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When you read a map you look at cardinal points (north, south, east and west), street names and specific buildings."}, {"type": "example", "content": "We go west from the bus station."}, {"type": "text", "content": "These help you find the place you want to go to. It's a good idea to use a compass or GPS when you are in a new city. Knowing where north, south, east and west are is very helpful when you ask for and listen to directions."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Then we walk south on Liberty Street."}, {"type": "image", "content": "engenn2le09ob01img01.jpg"}, {"type": "example", "content": "The bank is north of the harbor."}, {"type": "example", "content": "The mountains are in the east."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Prepositions and Expressions of Place"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use prepositions of place to say where you are or where you want to go. They help you say the place more clearly."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":7,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Preposition/ Expression of Place</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Meaning</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Examples</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"on the corner\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"where 2 streets meet\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">The museum is on the corner of Liberty and Main Streets.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"along\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"forward\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Walk along Main Street.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"at\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"a specific place\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">He's at Paul Revere's house.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"by\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"near; beside\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">There are restaurants by the harbor.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"toward\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"in the direction of\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Walk toward the water.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use when you read a map."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "county fair "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an event with farm animals and products from a region"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We go to the county fair to see the horse show every year."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le09ob01aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "upside down "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "not in the correct orientation  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Your map is upside down. You are looking in the wrong direction."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le09ob01aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "north "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "where a compass points "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Polar bears live in the north."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le09ob01aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "south "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "opposite to north "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Penguins live in the far south."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le09ob01aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "east "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "where the sun rises "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: New England is in the east of the USA."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le09ob01aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "west "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "where the sun goes down  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: California is in the west in the USA."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le09ob01aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "toward "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "in that direction"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(preposition)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Walk down this street toward the harbor."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le09ob01aud07"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn2le09ob01re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Write directions to the place."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Say the directions aloud."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Give the street names."}, {"type": "text", "content": " Use prepositions to help give directions."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Ask a person to read the directions. Are they clear?"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I write 20 to 30 words."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I explain where a place is."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I use street names."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I ask a person to read the directions."}]}]}